#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/architecture.md:3
#: 7533a43fb03443fba1aee567f2088776
msgid ""
"A React and TypeScript learning client organized around challenges, guided "
"planning, and reviewable learner actions."
msgstr ""
"Un client d'apprentissage React et TypeScript organise autour de defis, "
"d'une planification guidee et d'actions apprenantes revisables."

